  "sentences": [
    {
      "t0": 0.05,
      "t1": 4.902,
      "text": "I woke up this morning, and something was seriously wrong with the world."
    },
    {
      "t0": 4.902,
      "t1": 7.279,
      "text": "A bird was flying backward."
    },
    {
      "t0": 7.279,
      "t1": 9.672,
      "text": "The rain was falling up into the sky."
    },
    {
      "t0": 9.672,
      "t1": 15.786,
      "text": "And my neighbor had been standing in the exact same position for three hours, with one leg inside a wall."
    },
    {
      "t0": 15.786,
      "t1": 18.043,
      "text": "I thought I was losing my mind."
    },
    {
      "t0": 18.043,
      "t1": 20.545,
      "text": "Then I tried to open my front door."
    },
    {
      "t0": 20.545,
      "t1": 22.963,
      "text": "It led to the middle of the ocean."
    },
    {
      "t0": 22.963,
      "t1": 28.133,
      "text": "I slammed it shut, opened it again, and suddenly I was standing in a grocery store."
    },
    {
      "t0": 28.133,
      "t1": 30.461,
      "text": "Every single item had my face on it."
    },
    {
      "t0": 30.461,
      "t1": 31.702,
      "text": "Even the milk."
    },
    {
      "t0": 31.702,
      "t1": 36.907,
      "text": "I decided the smartest thing to do was stay inside and wait for reality to fix itself."
    },
    {
      "t0": 36.907,
      "t1": 38.664,
      "text": "Terrible decision."
    },
    {
      "t0": 38.664,
      "t1": 43.947,
      "text": "At exactly noon, the sky turned blue and a giant error message appeared above the city."
    },
    {
      "t0": 43.947,
      "t1": 47.51,
      "text": "\"REALITY UPDATE FAILED. RESTARTING IN 100 DAYS.\""
    },
    {
      "t0": 47.51,
      "t1": 49.412,
      "text": "Then everyone froze."
    },
    {
      "t0": 49.412,
      "t1": 50.713,
      "text": "Everyone except me."
    },
    {
      "t0": 50.713,
      "t1": 56.599,
      "text": "I walked outside and waved my hand in front of a frozen police officer. Nothing."
    },
    {
      "t0": 56.599,
      "t1": 62.072,
      "text": "I threw a rock at a car, and the rock turned into a chicken halfway through the air."
    },
    {
      "t0": 62.072,
      "t1": 69.274,
      "text": "I was about to celebrate my new life as the world's most powerful idiot when I noticed something across the street."
    },
    {
      "t0": 69.274,
      "t1": 70.935,
      "text": "A second stickman."
    },
    {
      "t0": 70.935,
      "t1": 72.764,
      "text": "He was moving, too."
    },
    {
      "t0": 72.764,
      "t1": 77.894,
      "text": "He stared directly at me, pointed toward the sky, and mouthed three words."
    },
    {
      "t0": 77.894,
      "t1": 79.431,
      "text": "\"You're not real.\""
    },
    {
      "t0": 79.431,
      "t1": 81.132,
      "text": "Then he disappeared."
    },
    {
      "t0": 81.132,
      "t1": 83.515,
      "text": "A countdown appeared above my head."
    },
    {
      "t0": 83.515,
      "t1": 85.532,
      "text": "99 days, 23 hours, 59 minutes."
    },
    {
      "t0": 85.532,
      "t1": 90.845,
      "text": "And suddenly, I had a much bigger problem than backward birds and chicken rocks."
    },
    {
      "t0": 90.845,
      "t1": 94.689,
      "text": "I had to figure out who created this world before it restarted."
    },
    {
      "t0": 94.689,
      "t1": 98.803,
      "text": "Because something tells me the next update isn't going to be pretty."
    },
    {
      "t0": 98.803,
      "t1": 100.723,
      "text": "So, what should I do first?"
    },
    {
      "t0": 100.723,
      "t1": 105.372,
      "text": "A: Break into the mysterious building where the countdown began."
    },
    {
      "t0": 105.372,
      "t1": 108.665,
      "text": "B: Find the stickman who said I'm not real."
    },
    {
      "t0": 108.665,
      "t1": 110.326,
      "text": "Choose carefully."
    },
    {
      "t0": 110.326,
      "t1": 113.645,
      "text": "We've got 100 days to figure out what the hell is happening."
    }
  ]
}